OL,3,GNEWSABadenoch backs face covering ban
OL,4,Aat protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch says
OL,7,Fshe would support a ban on face
OL,8,Fcoverings at protests if police believe
OL,9,Fone is needed.
OL,11,FHer comments follow protests in Dover
OL,12,Fon 5 September when men wearing black
OL,13,Fclothing and balaclavas blocked the
OL,14,Fmain roads for several hours.
OL,16,FBadenoch said she respected people's
OL,17,Fright to protest but was "not a fan of
OL,18,Fface coverings", adding: "What I don't
OL,19,Fwant to see is people using protest as
OL,20,Fa cover for committing crimes and
OL,21,Fbelieving that they can hide from
OL,22,Fthem."
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
