OL,3,GNEWSABadenoch backs face covering ban
OL,4,Aat protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent Police said it was considering
OL,7,Fwhether to take steps to order the
OL,8,Fremoval of face coverings under
OL,9,Flegislation available to the police.
